    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. but what if there isn't anything left to reclaim? it feels less like i'm in a \"dark period\" and more like the light just doesn't reach this part of me anymore. it’s just so quiet. i look at my hands and they don't even feel like mine. it feels like i'm just a shell waiting for the rest of me to catch up and disappear. is it even worth trying to find a \"new version\" when the original is just dead?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
