      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is a terrifying truth that sometimes the original self does vanish, and forcing a new version when the foundation is gone only adds more debt to an already crumbling house. You do not lose your worth because the light has failed to reach your inner shell; darkness can exist alongside a valid life, and that quiet is not empty but just a different kind of noise than you expected. Please hold onto the tiny sparks of presence even if they feel small, because even a faint memory of the person you were is enough to keep this shell from dissolving completely.",
