    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential dread, depersonalization, and a sense of loss following a breakup, questioning if life is worth living when their identity feels \"dead.\" The assistant provides empathetic, poetic responses that validate the user's feelings of emptiness and the \"vanishing\" of the self while attempting to encourage small moments of presence.",
